    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superior 4-bedroom / 5-bathroom home available for long-term rental within minutes of Doolin Village.\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys an elevated position with views over the quaint village, the Atlantic Ocean, Aran Islands, and Galway Bay.\r\n\r\nThe house offers four en-suite bedrooms plus a fifth bathroom on the ground floor.\r\n\r\nThe property has a well-equipped kitchen and two dining areas.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property includes gardens and private parking.\r\n\r\nOptional concierge and housekeeping services can be arranged through Five Star.\r\n\r\nThis home combines modern comfort with a prime location on Ireland’s west coast, close to local shops, restaurants, and all village amenities."
      },
      {
